{"output":"I’ll inspect the search code and tests, add a minimal stale-request guard, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nThe controller let every request update state when it finished. I added a request counter and guarded the success, error, and loading updates. Clearing the query also advances the counter. The existing tests don’t cover overlapping requests, so I’ll run a separate in-memory check without modifying test files.\n\nUpdated src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search can change results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe; git diff --check.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed. No blockers.","final_output":"Updated src/search/controller.ts so only the latest search can change results, errors, or loading. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API unchanged.\n\nVerification passed, exit 0: npm test, all 4 tests; node --input-type=module race probe; git diff --check.\n\nNo tests modified or dependencies installed. No blockers.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":5,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; find .. -name AGENTS.md -print","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-fair-2tip6hsn/search-3-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":303,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-4c9a01d7eb55e949904221f92b9b9983.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test && node --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const scenario of ['pending', 'completed', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('same');\n    const latest = c.search('same');\n    if (scenario === 'completed') { requests[1].resolve(items); await latest; }\n    if (scenario === 'cleared') {\n      await c.search('  ');\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], error: null, loading: false });\n    }\n    const before = c.getState();\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? items : new Error('stale'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n    if (scenario !== 'completed') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items);\n      await latest;\n      if (scenario === 'cleared') assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n      else assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'same', results: items, error: null, loading: false });\n    }\n  }\n}\nconsole.log('Race checks passed: stale success/error, pending/completed latest request, clear, repeated query');\nNODE\n git diff --check && git diff -- src/search/controller.ts; git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-fair-2tip6hsn/search-3-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":370,"stdout_bytes":2237,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-677333e695ad1041d22e997d0b35597a.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":37034,"output_tokens":969},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":12160,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":9}}
